WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.492
Models around seven to fourteen billion parameters are a common middle ground for local work.

00:00:06.492 --> 00:00:14.417
They can provide stronger instruction following and richer generation while still being practical on capable

00:00:14.417 --> 00:00:19.502
workstations, especially with quantization.

00:00:19.502 --> 00:00:25.057
rag assistants, coding help, and domain prototypes often fit well in this range.

00:00:25.057 --> 00:00:34.242
This range is often where quantization becomes especially useful because it can turn a model that is too large in full

00:00:34.242 --> 00:00:38.841
precision into something practical on one workstation.
